            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. If the parties mutually agree to the selection of the arbitrator, a letter signed by both parties shall promptly be sent to the arbitrator notifying him or her of his/her selection and requesting a hearing date. In the event the parties anticipate a hearing involving more than one day, they shall at the time of notice to the arbitrator of his or her selection estimate the number of days the hearing will require. Available arbitration date(s) shall not be any earlier than 21 calendar days from the arbitrator's receipt of his or her selection to hear the arbitration.",
            "block_bbox": [
                183,
                153,
                1122,
                349
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    183.0,
                    153.0
                ],
                [
                    1122.0,
                    153.0
                ],
                [
                    1122.0,
                    349.0
                ],
                [
                    183.0,
                    349.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. If the parties fail to reach mutual agreement as to the selection of an arbitrator for a grievance appealed to arbitration pursuant to Section D above, selection shall be made as follows:",
            "block_bbox": [
                182,
                374,
                1121,
                458
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    182.0,
                    374.0
                ],
                [
                    1121.0,
                    374.0
                ],
                [
                    1121.0,
                    458.0
                ],
                [
                    182.0,
                    458.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. The names of five members from the northern or southern permanent panel group shall be drawn by blind lot.",
            "block_bbox": [
                254,
                485,
                1120,
                543
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    254.0,
                    485.0
                ],
                [
                    1120.0,
                    485.0
                ],
                [
                    1120.0,
                    543.0
                ],
                [
                    254.0,
                    543.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. The parties shall alternately strike names from the list of five. The flip of a coin shall determine the party to begin the alternate process of the striking of the names.",
            "block_bbox": [
                253,
                567,
                1120,
                651
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    253.0,
                    567.0
                ],
                [
                    1120.0,
                    567.0
                ],
                [
                    1120.0,
                    651.0
                ],
                [
                    253.0,
                    651.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. The one name remaining after each party has stricken two names shall be the arbitrator designated to conduct the hearing.",
            "block_bbox": [
                253,
                678,
                1120,
                735
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    253.0,
                    678.0
                ],
                [
                    1120.0,
                    678.0
                ],
                [
                    1120.0,
                    735.0
                ],
                [
                    253.0,
                    735.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "d. If both parties mutually disagree with the arbitrator name which has been selected using the above process, the process shall be repeated in its entirety in order to determine a selected arbitrator.",
            "block_bbox": [
                253,
                760,
                1120,
                845
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    253.0,
                    760.0
                ],
                [
                    1120.0,
                    760.0
                ],
                [
                    1120.0,
                    845.0
                ],
                [
                    253.0,
                    845.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "e. If, after two attempts, the parties mutually disagree with the arbitrator selected, then one party, chosen by the flip of a coin, shall draw one name by blind lot from the northern or southern group and that arbitrator shall hear the arbitration case.",
            "block_bbox": [
                252,
                870,
                1121,
                982
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
